@startuml KTOB_07_sequence_add_book
title KTOB - Add Catalog or Private Manual Work
actor Reader
participant "Angular" as UI
participant "Spring API" as API
participant "Auth guard" as Guard
participant "Catalog" as Catalog
participant "Open Library adapter" as OL
participant "Library" as Library
database "Supabase PostgreSQL" as DB
Reader -> UI : Search or enter work
alt Catalog search selected
 UI -> API : GET /catalog/works?q=...
 API -> Catalog : search
 Catalog -> OL : Query metadata
 OL --> Catalog : matches or unavailable
 Catalog --> API : results / fallback
API --> UI : results / fallback
else Private manual entry selected
 UI -> API : POST /catalog/manual-works
 API -> Guard : verify JWT
 Guard --> API : readerId
 API -> Catalog : create MANUAL work owned by readerId
 Catalog -> DB : insert canonical work with owner_reader_id
 DB --> Catalog : workId
 Catalog --> API : created workId
API --> UI : 201 workId
end
Reader -> UI : Add selected work
UI -> API : POST /library (workId, preferredEditionId?)
API -> Guard : verify JWT
Guard --> API : readerId
API -> Library : authorize work visible to reader
Library -> DB : check work origin/owner, optional edition
alt Private work owned by another reader OR invalid edition
 DB --> Library : denied
 Library --> API : denied
API --> UI : 404 work / 422 invalid edition
else Existing entry incl. archived
 DB --> Library : duplicate readerId + workId
 Library --> API : duplicate
API --> UI : 409 duplicate (restore separately)
else Valid new entry
 Library -> DB : insert library entry; no reading experience
 DB --> Library : stored entry
 Library --> API : created entry
API --> UI : 201 shelfStatus=WANT_TO_READ
end
opt Reader explicitly restores an archived entry
 UI -> API : POST /library/{entryId}/restore
 API -> Guard : verify owner of archived entry
 Guard --> API : owned, archived
 API -> Library : clear archivedAt, retain memberships
 Library -> DB : restore original row
 Library --> API : restored entry
 API --> UI : 200, prior collection memberships visible
end
note over UI,DB
Unowned entry: 404 before archive check.
Archived descendants reject writes: 409 LIBRARY_ENTRY_ARCHIVED.
No inferred possession, reading start, or acquisition.
Manual works are created BEFORE library insertion.
end note
@enduml
